<title>DENMARK: TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-COPENHAGEN OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles semi-final</p>
<p>results in the $203,000 Copenhagen Open ATP tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat 6-Karol Kucera (Slovakia)</p>
<p>6-4 3-6 6-3</p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Lars Burgsmueller (Germany)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
